00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:14,740
(Watch on KonFlix.vip)

1
00:01:20,990 --> 00:01:26,730
[A Splendid Match]

2
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:29,620
[Episode 16]

3
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:33,509
It's all my fault.

4
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:43,759
Are there any

5
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:46,660
songs you want to hear?

6
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:54,280
Anything is fine.

7
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:29,970
The one thing this post station

8
00:02:31,630 --> 00:02:33,200
doesn't lack

9
00:02:33,630 --> 00:02:35,960
is a broken heart.

10
00:04:20,339 --> 00:04:24,270
[Ji's Depot in Tongzhou]

11
00:04:25,180 --> 00:04:26,580
Come, put it over here.

12
00:04:26,870 --> 00:04:28,800
I see Miss Gu

13
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:30,480
working at the depot every day recently.

14
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:31,810
She's truly exhausted.

15
00:04:33,270 --> 00:04:34,400
It's good to be busy.

16
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:35,720
It leaves less time to worry.

17
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:36,320
Over here.

18
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:40,680
I wonder

19
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:42,430
if the water transport is open yet.

20
00:04:42,430 --> 00:04:44,220
No way. It's completely silted up.

21
00:04:44,220 --> 00:04:45,830
A large canal ship with a carrying capacity
of 55,000 kilograms

22
00:04:45,830 --> 00:04:47,050
can't get through at all.

23
00:04:47,050 --> 00:04:48,780
The only option is to go by land.

24
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:50,430
What should we do then?

25
00:04:50,430 --> 00:04:52,000
If grain prices keep rising,

26
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:53,730
how are we supposed to survive?

27
00:04:53,750 --> 00:04:55,880
It doesn't matter if we survive or not.

28
00:04:56,159 --> 00:04:57,270
The real problem is
the Nine Border Garrisons.

29
00:04:57,270 --> 00:04:58,360
If war breaks out

30
00:04:58,390 --> 00:04:59,390
and the soldiers have no rations,

31
00:04:59,390 --> 00:05:00,600
that's when we're truly done for.

32
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:01,950
I've heard that in Shanxi,

33
00:05:01,950 --> 00:05:03,610
the drought is still ongoing.

34
00:05:04,430 --> 00:05:05,230
Third Master,

35
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:06,830
I just received news.

36
00:05:06,830 --> 00:05:07,830
The grain transport team

37
00:05:07,830 --> 00:05:09,230
is not far from Tongzhou.

38
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:12,510
You guessed it right.

39
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:16,160
They...

40
00:05:16,430 --> 00:05:18,870
They did use the Ji family's fleet.

41
00:05:21,310 --> 00:05:22,600
They are counting on

42
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:24,390
my relationship with the Ji family,

43
00:05:24,390 --> 00:05:26,190
thinking that even if I find out,

44
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:27,840
I won't dare to say anything.

45
00:05:29,510 --> 00:05:31,040
Stick to the original plan.

46
00:05:31,750 --> 00:05:32,950
Follow them closely,

47
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:35,380
but don't alert them.

48
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:36,000
Yes.

49
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:38,430
Hello, Second Master.

50
00:05:38,430 --> 00:05:39,690
Hello, Second Master.

51
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:43,159
Second Cousin,

52
00:05:43,750 --> 00:05:45,120
I thought you were in Sanhe.

53
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:46,050
Why are you back?

54
00:05:46,480 --> 00:05:47,750
The grain transport team
is arriving today.

55
00:05:47,750 --> 00:05:49,210
Of course I have to be here.

56
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:50,190
Yao.

57
00:05:52,240 --> 00:05:53,240
Every time I come to the depot,

58
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:54,100
I see you here.

59
00:05:55,190 --> 00:05:55,830
As a girl,

60
00:05:55,830 --> 00:05:57,760
aren't you afraid of getting a tan?

61
00:06:08,720 --> 00:06:09,920
I don't lack jewelry.

62
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:11,290
It's not jewelry.

63
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:14,380
It's your favorite scallion-shaped candy.

64
00:06:21,390 --> 00:06:22,720
Thank goodness.

65
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:24,330
You finally smiled.

66
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:28,050
I heard from Uncle Ping.

67
00:06:28,120 --> 00:06:29,000
You sent men to investigate

68
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:30,000
shops in Shanxi.

69
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:31,600
Since when

70
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:33,260
are you interested in Shanxi?

71
00:06:35,870 --> 00:06:37,750
Since you're here,

72
00:06:38,270 --> 00:06:40,200
please keep an eye on things for me.

73
00:06:40,630 --> 00:06:41,960
I want to go out for a walk

74
00:06:42,190 --> 00:06:43,450
and get some fresh air.

75
00:06:44,870 --> 00:06:46,100
-Zhao.
-The grain carts are here!

76
00:06:46,100 --> 00:06:47,360
The grain carts are finally here.

77
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:47,830
They're here.

78
00:06:47,830 --> 00:06:48,680
The grain carts are here!

79
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:49,680
Let's go.

80
00:06:49,830 --> 00:06:50,740
The grain carts are here!

81
00:06:50,740 --> 00:06:54,830
[Good weather for the crops]

82
00:06:55,190 --> 00:06:56,590
The grain carts are here.

83
00:06:57,360 --> 00:06:58,760
The grain carts are here.

84
00:07:00,750 --> 00:07:01,880
Get ready to unload.

85
00:07:09,940 --> 00:07:12,850
[Ji's Depot]

86
00:07:10,270 --> 00:07:11,870
Count all the grain first.

87
00:07:12,270 --> 00:07:12,850
Everyone...

88
00:07:12,850 --> 00:07:18,070
[Ji]

89
00:07:12,950 --> 00:07:14,310
Use your previous vouchers

90
00:07:14,310 --> 00:07:16,170
to claim your pre-ordered goods.

91
00:07:16,310 --> 00:07:17,360
Pay the silver,

92
00:07:17,390 --> 00:07:18,390
and get the grain.

93
00:07:20,800 --> 00:07:22,560
I know what you are worried about.

94
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:23,520
Our master said

95
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:25,270
prices won't increase by a single cent.

96
00:07:25,270 --> 00:07:26,600
That's good.

97
00:07:26,490 --> 00:07:28,410
[Ji]

98
00:07:26,830 --> 00:07:29,070
The Ji family is righteous and kind!

99
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:30,970
Unload! Unload!

100
00:07:31,040 --> 00:07:31,560
Okay.

101
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:32,720
-Unload!
-Unload! Unload!

102
00:07:31,690 --> 00:07:33,870
[Ji]

103
00:07:32,830 --> 00:07:33,890
Hurry up! Be quick!

104
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:34,830
Hurry up!

105
00:07:46,680 --> 00:07:49,010
Why does that guy look somewhat familiar?

106
00:07:57,870 --> 00:08:00,870
They look a bit like those bandits
from the Southwest.

107
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:02,000
Are you sure?

108
00:08:02,430 --> 00:08:04,760
I've played with them in a gambling house.

109
00:08:04,870 --> 00:08:06,200
It seems like it's them.

110
00:08:07,240 --> 00:08:08,240
What should we do?

111
00:08:11,810 --> 00:08:13,950
[Ji]

112
00:08:13,430 --> 00:08:15,360
This grain cart is headed to Miyun.

113
00:08:16,870 --> 00:08:17,870
Go ahead.

114
00:08:24,190 --> 00:08:26,240
Please stop causing trouble!

115
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:27,890
My sister clearly told you.

116
00:08:27,920 --> 00:08:28,680
She is going to transport

117
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:29,800
half of the grain here to the capital.

118
00:08:29,800 --> 00:08:31,000
Why are you intercepting it?

119
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:31,750
Why?

120
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:33,909
Because the grain shops in the capital

121
00:08:33,909 --> 00:08:35,320
are offering too low a price.

122
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:36,150
Do you know

123
00:08:36,150 --> 00:08:36,940
how much effort I put

124
00:08:36,940 --> 00:08:37,630
into collecting this grain?

125
00:08:37,630 --> 00:08:38,210
I don't care.

126
00:08:38,210 --> 00:08:39,669
I only listen to my sister.

127
00:08:39,669 --> 00:08:41,130
You guys, those things...

128
00:08:53,120 --> 00:08:53,600
Get up.

129
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:54,950
Get up.

130
00:08:59,000 --> 00:08:59,550
Fine.

131
00:08:59,750 --> 00:09:01,010
I won't argue with you.

132
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:02,510
Let's go ask Grandmother to judge.

133
00:09:02,510 --> 00:09:03,710
Judge? Let's go then!

134
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:04,370
Let's go.

135
00:09:19,870 --> 00:09:20,960
It seems they also noticed

136
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:22,360
that something is wrong.

137
00:09:23,340 --> 00:09:24,660
This commotion

138
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:26,700
might alert them.

139
00:09:26,870 --> 00:09:28,470
Those guys are desperadoes.

140
00:09:30,270 --> 00:09:32,070
The Ji family might be in danger.

141
00:09:32,870 --> 00:09:33,750
Here's the plan.

142
00:09:33,750 --> 00:09:34,680
You take some men

143
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:36,340
and continue following the grain carts.

144
00:09:36,340 --> 00:09:37,740
I'll go check things out.

145
00:09:51,030 --> 00:09:52,240
I saw it clearly.

146
00:09:52,510 --> 00:09:54,670
They are those bandits from the Southwest.

147
00:09:54,670 --> 00:09:55,790
And what's in those sacks

148
00:09:55,790 --> 00:09:56,910
is definitely not rice.

149
00:09:56,910 --> 00:09:57,640
It's swords.

150
00:09:57,870 --> 00:09:58,870
What should we do?

151
00:09:59,000 --> 00:10:00,000
It seems they want

152
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:01,440
to use our grain transport team

153
00:10:01,440 --> 00:10:03,240
to smuggle weapons into the capital.

154
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:06,170
Illegally transporting weapons
is a serious crime.

155
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:07,660
Listen, Rong.

156
00:10:07,790 --> 00:10:08,870
Go inform Zhao.

157
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:10,360
Tell her the situation here.

158
00:10:10,360 --> 00:10:12,200
She should have a way
to find Third Master.

159
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:13,790
I'll try to keep these bandits distracted.

160
00:10:13,790 --> 00:10:14,790
And I'll send someone to Tongzhou Guard

161
00:10:14,790 --> 00:10:15,790
to gather some men

162
00:10:16,150 --> 00:10:17,790
and surround the depot from the outside.

163
00:10:17,790 --> 00:10:19,000
Anyway, no matter what,

164
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:20,080
we must not let these weapons

165
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:21,450
leave our depot.

166
00:10:21,550 --> 00:10:22,000
Okay.

167
00:10:22,360 --> 00:10:23,360
I'll go right now.

168
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:24,000
Go.

169
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:39,740
Give me one.

170
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:42,870
Zhao!

171
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:46,080
The goods are problematic!

172
00:10:46,080 --> 00:10:47,280
Go find Third Master!

173
00:10:50,960 --> 00:10:52,040
I told you.

174
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:53,360
It's useless to capture me.

175
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:53,720
Move.

176
00:10:54,480 --> 00:10:55,840
You want to use me

177
00:10:55,960 --> 00:10:56,840
to blackmail Chen Yanyun,

178
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:57,440
don't you?

179
00:10:57,720 --> 00:10:58,270
Move!

180
00:10:58,270 --> 00:10:59,420
You're mistaken.

181
00:11:00,030 --> 00:11:00,870
Our Ji family

182
00:11:00,870 --> 00:11:02,550
are merely servants to the Chen family.

183
00:11:02,550 --> 00:11:03,670
Throughout history,

184
00:11:03,670 --> 00:11:05,360
servants die for their masters.

185
00:11:05,360 --> 00:11:06,320
When have you ever seen

186
00:11:06,320 --> 00:11:07,480
a master die for a servant?

187
00:11:07,480 --> 00:11:08,080
Am I right?

188
00:11:08,510 --> 00:11:09,310
Otherwise...

189
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:10,440
Why did you come to kidnap me?

190
00:11:10,440 --> 00:11:11,670
Why didn't your master come?

191
00:11:11,670 --> 00:11:12,720
Why are you so talkative?

192
00:11:12,720 --> 00:11:13,080
Move!

193
00:11:13,080 --> 00:11:13,750
Using me

194
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:16,030
won't get you leverage over Chen Yanyun,

195
00:11:16,030 --> 00:11:17,550
and it will cost you your life.

196
00:11:17,550 --> 00:11:19,030
Instead of losing both wealth
and your life,

197
00:11:19,030 --> 00:11:19,690
why don't we

198
00:11:20,030 --> 00:11:21,440
have a proper negotiation?

199
00:11:21,440 --> 00:11:22,640
Shut up! Move!

200
00:11:22,670 --> 00:11:23,670
Stop right there!

201
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:24,910
Don't come any closer,

202
00:11:24,910 --> 00:11:26,080
or I'll kill her!

203
00:11:27,550 --> 00:11:28,150
Let her go!

204
00:11:28,550 --> 00:11:29,030
Let her go

205
00:11:29,030 --> 00:11:31,290
and you might still have a chance to live.

206
00:11:32,200 --> 00:11:34,000
I am the one you want to deal with.

207
00:11:34,870 --> 00:11:35,480
Let her go

208
00:11:36,080 --> 00:11:37,360
and I will come with you.

209
00:11:37,360 --> 00:11:38,160
Go over there!

210
00:11:41,550 --> 00:11:42,750
Behind you is a cliff.

211
00:11:42,840 --> 00:11:43,900
You have no way out.

212
00:11:44,320 --> 00:11:45,020
Let her go.

213
00:11:45,550 --> 00:11:47,270
My life is worth more than hers.

214
00:11:47,270 --> 00:11:48,600
I wouldn't have guessed

215
00:11:48,910 --> 00:11:49,790
that a civil official like you

216
00:11:49,790 --> 00:11:51,150
actually had some guts.

217
00:11:51,200 --> 00:11:51,960
Let her go.

218
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:53,600
Throw your sword over!

219
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:54,150
Third Master.

220
00:11:54,150 --> 00:11:55,030
Don't worry about me!

221
00:11:55,030 --> 00:11:55,600
Hurry up!

222
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:00,600
Step back!

223
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:02,880
Further back!

224
00:12:09,870 --> 00:12:10,530
Don't move!

225
00:12:10,720 --> 00:12:11,920
Don't try any tricks!

226
00:12:13,440 --> 00:12:14,300
Don't hurt her!

227
00:12:17,550 --> 00:12:18,150
Jinzhao!

228
00:12:41,390 --> 00:12:42,080
Jinzhao!

229
00:12:44,680 --> 00:12:45,510
Hold me tight.

230
00:13:05,630 --> 00:13:06,240
Jinzhao,

231
00:13:06,840 --> 00:13:07,770
are you alright?

232
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:09,530
I think I sprained my ankle.

233
00:13:09,670 --> 00:13:10,630
Any other

234
00:13:10,630 --> 00:13:11,390
discomfort?

235
00:13:12,440 --> 00:13:14,070
No, just my ankle.

236
00:13:14,200 --> 00:13:15,550
Third Master, are you alright?

237
00:13:15,550 --> 00:13:16,390
This cliff isn't high,

238
00:13:16,390 --> 00:13:17,320
and the soil is soft.

239
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:17,870
I'm fine.

240
00:13:20,180 --> 00:13:21,200
Let me take a look.

241
00:13:29,440 --> 00:13:29,870
Ouch.

242
00:13:30,440 --> 00:13:32,100
Luckily it's not dislocated.

243
00:13:32,200 --> 00:13:33,510
A tendon is pulled.

244
00:13:34,120 --> 00:13:35,320
I can massage it back,

245
00:13:35,870 --> 00:13:37,130
but it might hurt a bit.

246
00:13:37,670 --> 00:13:38,530
Can you bear it?

247
00:14:00,750 --> 00:14:01,950
Feeling a bit better?

248
00:14:02,440 --> 00:14:03,240
Much better.

249
00:14:06,320 --> 00:14:07,580
It's nothing serious.

250
00:14:07,840 --> 00:14:09,500
It should be fine by tomorrow.

251
00:14:09,790 --> 00:14:11,630
But you can't walk too far yet.

252
00:14:16,390 --> 00:14:18,120
Even though it's not very deep,

253
00:14:18,510 --> 00:14:20,310
we can't get back up from here either.

254
00:14:20,310 --> 00:14:21,000
No hurry.

255
00:14:21,630 --> 00:14:22,510
It's not dark yet.

256
00:14:22,510 --> 00:14:23,120
Jiang Yan and the others

257
00:14:23,120 --> 00:14:24,780
will find us here soon enough.

258
00:14:37,720 --> 00:14:38,780
What are you doing?

259
00:14:45,720 --> 00:14:47,050
You'll know in a minute.

260
00:14:55,440 --> 00:14:56,080
Later,

261
00:14:56,840 --> 00:14:57,910
Jiang Yan and the others

262
00:14:57,910 --> 00:14:59,840
will see the smoke and find us here.

263
00:15:10,790 --> 00:15:12,320
What are you looking at now?

264
00:15:14,400 --> 00:15:15,330
You have already

265
00:15:15,600 --> 00:15:16,960
saved me many times.

266
00:15:17,670 --> 00:15:18,870
Actually, this time,

267
00:15:19,480 --> 00:15:21,030
it was me who dragged you into this.

268
00:15:21,030 --> 00:15:22,430
They are mainly after me.

269
00:15:23,110 --> 00:15:24,320
Rong said

270
00:15:24,670 --> 00:15:26,270
the goods were problematic.

271
00:15:27,140 --> 00:15:27,890
Could that

272
00:15:28,150 --> 00:15:29,750
be connected to them as well?

273
00:15:30,440 --> 00:15:31,150
They wanted to use

274
00:15:31,150 --> 00:15:33,080
my relationship with the Ji family

275
00:15:33,240 --> 00:15:34,770
to smuggle the weapons out.

276
00:15:35,390 --> 00:15:36,600
So that's how it is.

277
00:15:39,340 --> 00:15:40,450
You look

278
00:15:40,750 --> 00:15:41,910
a bit different

279
00:15:42,240 --> 00:15:43,370
from two months ago.

280
00:15:44,790 --> 00:15:45,630
Why?

281
00:15:46,720 --> 00:15:47,980
You don't talk as much,

282
00:15:48,670 --> 00:15:49,400
and you smile

283
00:15:49,840 --> 00:15:50,630
less too.

284
00:15:56,360 --> 00:15:57,820
I really feel much better.

285
00:16:00,360 --> 00:16:01,200
That's good.

286
00:16:21,150 --> 00:16:21,910
I heard

287
00:16:22,790 --> 00:16:23,550
that you bought

288
00:16:23,550 --> 00:16:25,150
a lot of properties in Shanxi

289
00:16:25,150 --> 00:16:27,080
and invested in a large draft bank.

290
00:16:29,490 --> 00:16:31,350
I didn't mean to investigate you.

291
00:16:31,360 --> 00:16:32,090
It's just that...

292
00:16:32,090 --> 00:16:33,390
Large draft banks in Shanxi

293
00:16:33,390 --> 00:16:35,480
are tied to the nation's
grain and finances.

294
00:16:35,480 --> 00:16:36,630
So the Court decrees

295
00:16:37,320 --> 00:16:38,870
that any change in share capital

296
00:16:38,870 --> 00:16:39,510
must

297
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:41,800
be reported to the authorities.

298
00:16:41,910 --> 00:16:42,670
Why did you suddenly

299
00:16:42,670 --> 00:16:44,330
become interested in Shanxi?

300
00:16:44,750 --> 00:16:46,000
I've just been

301
00:16:46,020 --> 00:16:47,150
thinking these days

302
00:16:47,320 --> 00:16:49,080
about where my future lies.

303
00:16:50,120 --> 00:16:51,390
I've thought it over

304
00:16:51,750 --> 00:16:53,080
and decided that Shanxi

305
00:16:53,510 --> 00:16:55,710
might be the most suitable place for me.

306
00:16:56,390 --> 00:16:57,920
You're not thinking of...?

307
00:16:59,630 --> 00:17:01,830
I plan to remain unmarried in the future

308
00:17:02,030 --> 00:17:03,030
and go to Shanxi

309
00:17:03,750 --> 00:17:05,010
to manage businesses.

310
00:17:06,400 --> 00:17:07,730
Because of your mother?

311
00:17:09,109 --> 00:17:09,790
Yes,

312
00:17:11,109 --> 00:17:12,040
partly

313
00:17:12,750 --> 00:17:14,030
because of my mother.

314
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:15,670
But

315
00:17:15,880 --> 00:17:16,920
not entirely.

316
00:17:18,240 --> 00:17:19,589
Sages all say that

317
00:17:20,109 --> 00:17:21,170
the key to marriage

318
00:17:21,270 --> 00:17:22,869
lies in mutual suitability.

319
00:17:23,200 --> 00:17:24,599
This means that marriage

320
00:17:24,640 --> 00:17:26,030
should be good for both parties.

321
00:17:26,030 --> 00:17:27,290
That's the principle.

322
00:17:28,480 --> 00:17:30,010
But when it comes to myself,

323
00:17:30,310 --> 00:17:31,680
I really can't think of

324
00:17:31,920 --> 00:17:33,270
any benefits

325
00:17:33,440 --> 00:17:34,840
marriage would bring me.

326
00:17:35,590 --> 00:17:36,450
So

327
00:17:36,590 --> 00:17:37,640
I've decided

328
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:38,840
not to take that risk.

329
00:17:45,480 --> 00:17:46,160
I'm sorry.

330
00:17:47,550 --> 00:17:48,880
I really shouldn't

331
00:17:49,240 --> 00:17:50,370
be telling you this.

332
00:17:51,440 --> 00:17:52,880
I've never thought about

333
00:17:54,030 --> 00:17:55,240
what you just said.

334
00:17:55,720 --> 00:17:57,200
I don't know how to answer.

335
00:17:58,350 --> 00:17:59,950
But your reasoning is sound.

336
00:18:00,070 --> 00:18:00,880
One

337
00:18:01,070 --> 00:18:02,270
should only do things

338
00:18:02,310 --> 00:18:03,640
that have some benefit.

339
00:18:05,750 --> 00:18:06,510
Then...

340
00:18:08,510 --> 00:18:10,110
When are you going to Shanxi?

341
00:18:12,160 --> 00:18:13,420
I haven't decided yet.

342
00:18:14,070 --> 00:18:14,970
But...

343
00:18:15,270 --> 00:18:16,440
If I go,

344
00:18:17,110 --> 00:18:18,200
it will be after I've seen out

345
00:18:18,200 --> 00:18:19,930
my grandmother's final years.

346
00:18:25,400 --> 00:18:26,480
-My Lady!
-Third Master!

347
00:18:26,480 --> 00:18:27,440
-Third Master!
-My Lady!

348
00:18:27,440 --> 00:18:28,720
-Third Master!
-Zhao!

349
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:29,880
-Third Master!
-My Lady!

350
00:18:29,880 --> 00:18:30,550
Zhao!

351
00:18:30,550 --> 00:18:31,480
-Third Master!
-My Lady!

352
00:18:31,480 --> 00:18:32,400
Third Master!

353
00:18:32,400 --> 00:18:33,330
-Zhao!
-My Lady!

354
00:18:33,480 --> 00:18:34,510
-My Lady!
-Zhao!

355
00:18:34,510 --> 00:18:35,000
What should we do?

356
00:18:35,000 --> 00:18:35,720
Third Master!

357
00:18:35,720 --> 00:18:36,480
It's only been a short while.

358
00:18:36,480 --> 00:18:38,280
How did something so big happen?

359
00:18:39,680 --> 00:18:40,240
Look!

360
00:18:41,200 --> 00:18:42,400
There's smoke over there!

361
00:18:42,400 --> 00:18:42,930
Let's go!

362
00:18:42,970 --> 00:18:43,500
Let's go.

363
00:18:43,920 --> 00:18:44,640
Go, go, go.

364
00:18:56,440 --> 00:18:57,620
Third Master,

365
00:18:57,750 --> 00:18:58,790
is he dead?

366
00:19:00,510 --> 00:19:01,930
He wasn't as lucky as we were.

367
00:19:01,930 --> 00:19:03,790
We had leaves to cushion our fall.

368
00:19:04,030 --> 00:19:05,210
But he hit this rock

369
00:19:05,550 --> 00:19:06,680
and that killed him.

370
00:19:07,880 --> 00:19:08,680
Third Master,

371
00:19:08,900 --> 00:19:10,000
look inside the robes on his chest.

372
00:19:10,000 --> 00:19:11,460
Is there something there?

373
00:19:14,160 --> 00:19:15,030
Banknotes.

374
00:19:15,370 --> 00:19:17,860
[Great Yan Bank
General Circulation Banknotes]

375
00:19:15,720 --> 00:19:17,550
Xinlong Bank, Guiyang Branch.

376
00:19:20,510 --> 00:19:21,770
There's also a letter.

377
00:19:22,710 --> 00:19:24,540
[The Ji family's merchant fleet
can be used]

378
00:19:24,440 --> 00:19:25,390
These bandits

379
00:19:25,440 --> 00:19:26,970
really had a plan all along.

380
00:19:27,550 --> 00:19:28,240
It seems they've had their eyes

381
00:19:28,240 --> 00:19:30,040
on your Ji family from the start.

382
00:19:30,920 --> 00:19:31,830
May I see it?

383
00:19:33,790 --> 00:19:35,430
[The Ji family's merchant fleet
can be used]

384
00:19:37,720 --> 00:19:38,440
My Lady.

385
00:19:38,460 --> 00:19:41,260
Here's a new prescription
from Divine Doctor Xiao

386
00:19:41,260 --> 00:19:42,760
[Astragalus 1 liang 8 qian,
Codonopsis 1 liang 5 qian]

387
00:19:42,780 --> 00:19:44,840
[Poria 1 liang 5 qian,
Atractylodes 1 liang 2 qian]

388
00:19:44,970 --> 00:19:47,020
[The Ji family's merchant fleet
can be used]

389
00:19:48,310 --> 00:19:49,000
Miss Gu.

390
00:19:52,070 --> 00:19:52,680
Jinzhao.

391
00:19:55,710 --> 00:19:57,230
[The Ji family's merchant fleet
can be used]

392
00:19:56,440 --> 00:19:58,680
This handwriting looks exactly the same

393
00:19:58,680 --> 00:20:00,160
as Divine Doctor Xiao's.

394
00:20:00,480 --> 00:20:01,830
He prescribed medicine for my mother.

395
00:20:01,830 --> 00:20:02,640
You mean

396
00:20:03,240 --> 00:20:05,270
the physician Ye Xian invited for you?

397
00:20:05,270 --> 00:20:05,830
Yes.

398
00:20:07,270 --> 00:20:08,430
His name is Xiao You.

399
00:20:08,640 --> 00:20:09,900
He's Ye Xian's master.

400
00:20:10,750 --> 00:20:11,680
Xiao You?

401
00:20:12,270 --> 00:20:13,530
What does he look like?

402
00:20:14,680 --> 00:20:16,010
High nose, narrow eyes,

403
00:20:16,200 --> 00:20:17,530
and thin lips as blades.

404
00:20:18,310 --> 00:20:18,840
Oh right,

405
00:20:19,200 --> 00:20:20,510
he has a growth

406
00:20:20,790 --> 00:20:22,840
on his left earlobe.

407
00:20:23,880 --> 00:20:25,010
Just as I suspected.

408
00:20:26,550 --> 00:20:27,550
No wonder I couldn't find him

409
00:20:27,550 --> 00:20:29,080
no matter how hard I looked.

410
00:20:29,440 --> 00:20:30,310
And here I was thinking

411
00:20:30,310 --> 00:20:31,720
how to protect
Marquis Changxing's Mansion.

412
00:20:31,720 --> 00:20:33,590
It seems he was hiding
right under our noses.

413
00:20:33,590 --> 00:20:35,250
You have been looking for him?

414
00:20:35,680 --> 00:20:36,440
Yes.

415
00:20:38,110 --> 00:20:39,710
Xiao You is not his real name.

416
00:20:40,110 --> 00:20:41,710
His real name is Xiao Qishan.

417
00:20:42,030 --> 00:20:43,960
He was the most capable strategist

418
00:20:44,160 --> 00:20:46,030
of the former Prince Chengqing's
residence.

419
00:20:46,030 --> 00:20:46,680
But...

420
00:20:47,400 --> 00:20:48,750
He is Ye Xian's master.

421
00:20:49,270 --> 00:20:50,670
Doesn't that mean Ye Xian

422
00:20:50,720 --> 00:20:52,160
and the entire Marquis Changxing's Mansion

423
00:20:52,160 --> 00:20:54,040
will be implicated in this?

424
00:20:56,070 --> 00:20:56,790
Yes.

425
00:21:01,640 --> 00:21:02,310
Zhao!

426
00:21:02,480 --> 00:21:03,280
Third Master!

427
00:21:03,750 --> 00:21:04,750
Apart from people of the Ji Mansion,

428
00:21:04,750 --> 00:21:05,350
all available constables and bailiffs

429
00:21:05,350 --> 00:21:06,920
from the Tongzhou Prefectural Office

430
00:21:06,920 --> 00:21:08,720
have gone out of the city to search.

431
00:21:08,720 --> 00:21:09,680
Old Madam Ji has also paid a heavy sum

432
00:21:09,680 --> 00:21:10,480
to hire experienced escort guards

433
00:21:10,480 --> 00:21:11,750
from both the Weiyuan
and Fuyuan Escort Agencies

434
00:21:11,750 --> 00:21:13,080
to help with the search.

435
00:21:13,350 --> 00:21:15,410
Thankfully, it didn't take too long.

436
00:21:16,270 --> 00:21:17,790
The bandits have all been caught.

437
00:21:17,790 --> 00:21:18,650
They confessed

438
00:21:19,030 --> 00:21:20,640
that they only had two leaders.

439
00:21:20,640 --> 00:21:21,650
And they are from the Southwest.

440
00:21:21,650 --> 00:21:22,590
The one who kidnapped Miss Gu

441
00:21:22,590 --> 00:21:23,480
was one of them.

442
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:25,200
And these two leaders

443
00:21:25,400 --> 00:21:27,350
take orders directly from Head Xiao.

444
00:21:27,350 --> 00:21:28,210
As for the rest,

445
00:21:28,680 --> 00:21:29,480
they are bandits recruited

446
00:21:29,480 --> 00:21:30,280
along the way.

447
00:21:31,880 --> 00:21:32,830
Did they confess

448
00:21:32,830 --> 00:21:33,960
where these weapons

449
00:21:34,110 --> 00:21:35,270
were supposed to go?

450
00:21:36,070 --> 00:21:36,750
To Prince Ruichang's manor

451
00:21:36,750 --> 00:21:38,410
in the suburbs of the capital.

452
00:21:39,310 --> 00:21:40,370
Just as I expected.

453
00:21:40,880 --> 00:21:41,680
Third Master,

454
00:21:42,000 --> 00:21:43,270
about Xiao Qishan

455
00:21:43,270 --> 00:21:45,530
hiding in Marquis Changxing's Mansion,

456
00:21:46,030 --> 00:21:47,890
should we keep it a secret for now?

457
00:21:50,440 --> 00:21:51,500
I spoke out of turn.

458
00:21:52,720 --> 00:21:53,880
Oh, you said

459
00:21:54,440 --> 00:21:56,040
only the two leaders

460
00:21:56,400 --> 00:21:57,640
were their own men,

461
00:21:58,030 --> 00:22:00,490
and the others were temporarily recruited?

462
00:22:01,720 --> 00:22:03,380
Then find another group of men

463
00:22:03,400 --> 00:22:04,720
and secretly

464
00:22:04,720 --> 00:22:05,880
deliver these goods

465
00:22:06,240 --> 00:22:07,840
to Prince Ruichang's manor.

466
00:22:07,920 --> 00:22:09,580
Pretend nothing happened.

467
00:22:09,960 --> 00:22:10,820
Can you do that?

468
00:22:12,240 --> 00:22:13,700
It shouldn't be a problem.

469
00:22:14,200 --> 00:22:15,530
We can do it discreetly.

470
00:22:15,830 --> 00:22:17,690
I'll go make arrangements first.

471
00:22:19,640 --> 00:22:20,170
Alright.

472
00:22:21,350 --> 00:22:22,280
Why are you here?

473
00:22:24,550 --> 00:22:25,750
Your foot is just getting better.

474
00:22:25,750 --> 00:22:26,550
Walk slower.

475
00:22:27,310 --> 00:22:28,030
Yes, I will.

476
00:22:29,160 --> 00:22:29,830
Third Master,

477
00:22:29,830 --> 00:22:30,830
I think Ye Xian

478
00:22:31,030 --> 00:22:32,920
definitely doesn't know about Xiao You.

479
00:22:32,920 --> 00:22:34,110
If he knew,

480
00:22:34,400 --> 00:22:35,400
he would surely hide him

481
00:22:35,400 --> 00:22:36,590
without hesitation.

482
00:22:36,590 --> 00:22:37,850
How could he willingly

483
00:22:37,880 --> 00:22:39,550
let him come treat my mother?

484
00:22:40,270 --> 00:22:41,880
He must be kept in the dark.

485
00:22:44,310 --> 00:22:45,590
That makes sense.

486
00:22:46,160 --> 00:22:46,790
But

487
00:22:47,160 --> 00:22:48,360
do you have any proof?

488
00:22:49,350 --> 00:22:51,210
Even if Ye Xian is kept in the dark,

489
00:22:51,400 --> 00:22:52,920
what about Marquis Changxing?

490
00:22:52,920 --> 00:22:54,520
Does he know nothing either?

491
00:22:59,270 --> 00:23:00,350
To be honest,

492
00:23:01,440 --> 00:23:02,200
I actually

493
00:23:02,880 --> 00:23:03,640
don't believe

494
00:23:03,640 --> 00:23:05,350
that Marquis Changxing
would commit treason.

495
00:23:05,350 --> 00:23:06,030
Because

496
00:23:06,480 --> 00:23:08,030
Marquis Changxing and the former
Prince Chengqing

497
00:23:08,030 --> 00:23:09,290
have a deep blood feud.

498
00:23:09,480 --> 00:23:10,290
Back then,

499
00:23:10,440 --> 00:23:12,310
when the former Prince Chengqing's
rebellion failed

500
00:23:12,310 --> 00:23:13,550
and he was defeated in battle,

501
00:23:13,550 --> 00:23:14,720
it was Marquis Changxing

502
00:23:14,720 --> 00:23:17,180
who cut him down with one stroke
of his blade.

503
00:23:18,070 --> 00:23:19,470
So that's what happened?

504
00:23:21,880 --> 00:23:22,680
Therefore,

505
00:23:23,480 --> 00:23:24,440
just one or two people

506
00:23:24,440 --> 00:23:26,170
not believing it is not enough.

507
00:23:26,200 --> 00:23:27,880
Xiao Qishan was protected
in Marquis Changxing's Mansion

508
00:23:27,880 --> 00:23:28,880
for so many years,

509
00:23:28,920 --> 00:23:30,650
and he is also Ye Xian's master.

510
00:23:30,720 --> 00:23:32,030
Based on these two points alone,

511
00:23:32,030 --> 00:23:33,000
Marquis Changxing

512
00:23:33,000 --> 00:23:34,600
cannot escape involvement.

513
00:23:36,160 --> 00:23:36,680
Then,

514
00:23:37,480 --> 00:23:39,750
do you have any way to save them?

515
00:23:46,160 --> 00:23:47,560
I don't have a way either.

516
00:23:51,440 --> 00:23:53,160
I know you want to help Ye Xian,

517
00:23:53,480 --> 00:23:55,590
but this is a very serious matter.

518
00:23:56,350 --> 00:23:57,070
You,

519
00:23:57,790 --> 00:23:58,440
me,

520
00:23:59,240 --> 00:24:00,030
the Ji family,

521
00:24:00,030 --> 00:24:00,790
and the Chen family...

522
00:24:00,790 --> 00:24:01,990
If we get implicated,

523
00:24:02,270 --> 00:24:03,870
the slightest carelessness

524
00:24:03,960 --> 00:24:05,690
could mean total destruction.

525
00:24:05,790 --> 00:24:06,850
Do you understand?

526
00:24:08,440 --> 00:24:09,270
I understand.

527
00:24:11,400 --> 00:24:13,000
Third Master, we can set off.

528
00:24:15,110 --> 00:24:15,640
Let's go.

529
00:24:16,160 --> 00:24:16,720
Then you

530
00:24:17,000 --> 00:24:18,260
should head back soon.

531
00:24:19,310 --> 00:24:20,640
Aren't you coming into the city?

532
00:24:20,640 --> 00:24:22,590
I need to rush back to the capital.

533
00:24:28,200 --> 00:24:28,690
Sister,

534
00:24:28,750 --> 00:24:29,750
let's go back too.

535
00:24:30,510 --> 00:24:31,570
I'm not going back.

536
00:24:32,480 --> 00:24:33,110
Yao,

537
00:24:33,440 --> 00:24:34,160
I have urgent business

538
00:24:34,160 --> 00:24:35,510
and need to return to the capital.

539
00:24:35,510 --> 00:24:36,570
Lend me two horses.

540
00:24:37,030 --> 00:24:38,310
And as for grandmother,

541
00:24:38,310 --> 00:24:39,640
find a way to cover for me

542
00:24:39,680 --> 00:24:40,640
with her.

543
00:24:41,640 --> 00:24:42,240
All right.

544
00:24:42,550 --> 00:24:43,270
Then you

545
00:24:43,270 --> 00:24:44,400
be very careful on the road.

546
00:24:44,400 --> 00:24:44,830
Okay.

547
00:24:47,110 --> 00:24:47,840
Give me that.

548
00:24:49,350 --> 00:24:49,790
Hyah!

549
00:24:49,790 --> 00:24:50,440
My Lady!

550
00:24:50,920 --> 00:24:52,070
Acting behind Third Master

551
00:24:52,070 --> 00:24:53,000
and sneaking back to the capital like this

552
00:24:53,000 --> 00:24:54,160
to inform the Young Master Ye,

553
00:24:54,160 --> 00:24:55,510
are we betraying Third Master?

554
00:24:55,510 --> 00:24:56,030
No.

555
00:24:56,480 --> 00:24:57,880
As long as it doesn't involve him,

556
00:24:57,880 --> 00:24:59,810
or the entire Ji and Chen families,

557
00:24:59,880 --> 00:25:00,750
it's fine.

558
00:25:01,440 --> 00:25:01,880
Hyah!

559
00:25:02,570 --> 00:25:05,180
[Ciqing Palace]

560
00:25:06,920 --> 00:25:07,510
Ye Xian,

561
00:25:07,720 --> 00:25:08,380
please sit.

562
00:25:14,400 --> 00:25:15,160
I'm

563
00:25:15,440 --> 00:25:16,570
not being alarmist.

564
00:25:17,550 --> 00:25:19,270
Ever since my father fell seriously ill,

565
00:25:19,270 --> 00:25:21,470
the palace has been in a state of unrest.

566
00:25:21,680 --> 00:25:24,110
All sorts of shady characters
have come out of the woodwork.

567
00:25:24,110 --> 00:25:26,040
Even I have heard it several times.

568
00:25:26,550 --> 00:25:28,000
They say I am too young

569
00:25:28,240 --> 00:25:29,880
to bear the weight of the throne

570
00:25:29,880 --> 00:25:32,540
and my father should pass it
to Prince Ruichang.

571
00:25:33,240 --> 00:25:34,100
Your Highness,

572
00:25:34,160 --> 00:25:35,680
you trust me too much.

573
00:25:36,510 --> 00:25:38,810
If I can't even tell

574
00:25:38,830 --> 00:25:40,750
whether you are loyal or treacherous,

575
00:25:40,750 --> 00:25:42,790
then I would truly be as those people say.

576
00:25:42,790 --> 00:25:44,680
"Can't bear the weight of the throne."

577
00:25:44,680 --> 00:25:45,510
I know

578
00:25:45,750 --> 00:25:46,960
that your Marquis Changxing's family

579
00:25:46,960 --> 00:25:48,420
are all incredibly loyal.

580
00:25:49,200 --> 00:25:50,160
Mother has said this

581
00:25:50,160 --> 00:25:51,510
several times.

582
00:25:51,830 --> 00:25:53,030
Mr. Chen also said it.

583
00:25:54,440 --> 00:25:55,700
Lord Chen also said it?

584
