What good things

872
00:39:26,760 --> 00:39:28,290
could I possibly have here?

873
00:39:28,880 --> 00:39:29,810
Bows and arrows?

874
00:39:29,880 --> 00:39:30,550
Daggers?

875
00:39:31,030 --> 00:39:32,070
Or hidden weapons?

876
00:39:32,070 --> 00:39:32,630
Poison?

877
00:39:34,150 --> 00:39:35,760
I just made this slingshot.

878
00:39:36,030 --> 00:39:37,090
Take it if you want.

879
00:39:40,070 --> 00:39:41,280
I don't want this.

880
00:39:43,360 --> 00:39:44,190
I just thought of the slingshot

881
00:39:44,190 --> 00:39:45,390
you gave me back then.

882
00:39:46,670 --> 00:39:48,130
Did I give you a slingshot?

883
00:39:48,920 --> 00:39:49,510
Yes.

884
00:39:50,510 --> 00:39:52,070
That year when I returned to the capital,

885
00:39:52,070 --> 00:39:53,070
I was only there for a day

886
00:39:53,070 --> 00:39:55,070
before I wrote you to come pick me up.

887
00:39:56,190 --> 00:39:57,170
From the first day of the New Year,

888
00:39:57,170 --> 00:39:59,230
I waited until the Lantern Festival.

889
00:40:00,150 --> 00:40:01,410
You were finally here.

890
00:40:06,360 --> 00:40:06,960
Ye Xian.

891
00:40:07,710 --> 00:40:08,590
Master!

892
00:40:15,110 --> 00:40:15,910
What's wrong?

893
00:40:16,080 --> 00:40:17,540
[Youth Ye Xian]

894
00:40:16,440 --> 00:40:17,570
Why are you unhappy?

895
00:40:18,440 --> 00:40:20,960
Look at what I brought you.

896
00:40:23,960 --> 00:40:25,360
I don't want a slingshot.

897
00:40:25,360 --> 00:40:26,440
I want a crossbow.

898
00:40:26,880 --> 00:40:28,440
You are still too young.

899
00:40:29,710 --> 00:40:30,800
I promise you.

900
00:40:31,070 --> 00:40:32,270
When you grow up a bit,

901
00:40:32,280 --> 00:40:34,410
I will definitely give you a crossbow.

902
00:40:36,280 --> 00:40:37,230
It's a deal.

903
00:40:37,590 --> 00:40:38,920
It's a deal.

904
00:40:42,590 --> 00:40:44,250
You have a really good memory.

905
00:40:44,510 --> 00:40:46,110
I don't remember that at all.

906
00:40:47,320 --> 00:40:48,670
Take this slingshot.

907
00:40:54,030 --> 00:40:54,690
Never mind.

908
00:40:56,150 --> 00:40:57,630
I'll find something else.

909
00:41:05,320 --> 00:41:06,280
This kid

910
00:41:06,480 --> 00:41:08,210
is acting quite strange today.

911
00:41:12,590 --> 00:41:13,450
Your Highness.

912
00:41:14,150 --> 00:41:15,880
I'm here to see your young lady.

913
00:41:28,150 --> 00:41:28,760
How is it?

914
00:41:29,070 --> 00:41:30,110
You guessed it right.

915
00:41:30,110 --> 00:41:31,770
Someone is indeed following.

916
00:41:40,880 --> 00:41:41,710
You finally believe

917
00:41:41,710 --> 00:41:42,670
what I said?

918
00:41:44,480 --> 00:41:45,030
Yes.

919
00:41:45,800 --> 00:41:47,280
I was afraid of arousing suspicion.

920
00:41:47,280 --> 00:41:48,070
So I could only use the excuse

921
00:41:48,070 --> 00:41:50,000
of returning Baopu to come see you.

922
00:41:50,800 --> 00:41:52,070
Is there a side door in your residence?

923
00:41:52,070 --> 00:41:53,150
I need to see Chen Yanyun.

924
00:41:53,150 --> 00:41:54,480
The sooner, the better.

925
00:41:54,630 --> 00:41:55,400
On the north side of our mansion,

926
00:41:55,400 --> 00:41:56,600
there is a small door.

927
00:41:56,760 --> 00:41:57,960
It leads directly to an alley

928
00:41:57,960 --> 00:41:59,120
and is very well-hidden.

929
00:41:59,120 --> 00:42:00,450
I'll take you there now.

930
00:42:26,800 --> 00:42:27,320
Master Xiao

931
00:42:27,320 --> 00:42:28,850
told me in front of my father

932
00:42:29,190 --> 00:42:31,150
that Prince Ruichang was secretly
hoarding weapons

933
00:42:31,150 --> 00:42:31,630
and secretly

934
00:42:31,630 --> 00:42:33,280
conspiring with
the Northern City Military Commander

935
00:42:33,280 --> 00:42:34,800
and the Imperial Golden Guard.

936
00:42:34,800 --> 00:42:35,920
The way I see it,

937
00:42:36,800 --> 00:42:38,320
it seems like he's helping my father

938
00:42:38,320 --> 00:42:40,850
guard against Prince Ruichang's rebellion.

939
00:42:42,030 --> 00:42:43,890
I believe Zhao wouldn't lie to me.

940
00:42:44,150 --> 00:42:45,440
But if that's the case,

941
00:42:46,280 --> 00:42:47,400
Xiao You essentially

942
00:42:47,400 --> 00:42:48,930
told my father everything.

943
00:42:50,960 --> 00:42:52,020
This situation...

944
00:42:52,630 --> 00:42:54,030
I find it confusing.

945
00:42:56,150 --> 00:42:57,030
Could it be that

946
00:42:57,510 --> 00:42:59,910
Xiao You didn't betray Marquis Changxing?

947
00:43:00,030 --> 00:43:01,280
But those weapons...

948
00:43:01,590 --> 00:43:02,550
Why did he transport them

949
00:43:02,550 --> 00:43:03,800
to Prince Ruichang?

950
00:43:05,670 --> 00:43:07,270
What confuses me most is that

951
00:43:07,510 --> 00:43:08,670
Xiao You, on one hand, has my father

952
00:43:08,670 --> 00:43:10,110
guard against Prince Ruichang,

953
00:43:10,110 --> 00:43:10,960
yet on the other hand,

954
00:43:10,960 --> 00:43:13,160
he secretly works for Prince Ruichang.

955
00:43:13,190 --> 00:43:14,440
What is he after?

956
00:43:17,320 --> 00:43:19,980
The Marquis is extremely loyal
to the Great Yan.

957
00:43:20,070 --> 00:43:21,850
He hates traitors the most.

958
00:43:22,480 --> 00:43:24,230
When the Prince Chengqing rebelled,

959
00:43:24,230 --> 00:43:25,230
it was the Marquis

960
00:43:25,400 --> 00:43:27,200
who cut him down with one stroke.

961
00:43:28,840 --> 00:43:29,670
Now,

962
00:43:30,630 --> 00:43:32,690
if the Marquis knows Prince Ruichang

963
00:43:33,190 --> 00:43:34,720
has the intention to rebel,

964
00:43:35,250 --> 00:43:37,060
how could he just sit and wait?

965
00:43:38,000 --> 00:43:40,400
He will definitely gather troops secretly

966
00:43:40,710 --> 00:43:43,370
and get ready to protect the Emperor
at any time.

967
00:43:43,400 --> 00:43:44,670
But if so,

968
00:43:45,070 --> 00:43:46,230
the Marquis's actions

969
00:43:46,230 --> 00:43:47,490
might become evidence

970
00:43:47,580 --> 00:43:49,180
of his own future rebellion.

971
00:43:52,920 --> 00:43:53,550
This

972
00:43:54,550 --> 00:43:56,480
is probably what Xiao You is after.

973
00:44:01,400 --> 00:44:02,710
Right now, the Marquis's Mansion

974
00:44:02,710 --> 00:44:04,240
is in a hopeless situation.

975
00:44:04,590 --> 00:44:06,120
If Prince Ruichang rebels,

976
00:44:06,710 --> 00:44:07,710
the Marquis will definitely

977
00:44:07,710 --> 00:44:09,590
lead troops into the palace
to protect His Majesty.

978
00:44:09,590 --> 00:44:10,120
Not to act

979
00:44:10,510 --> 00:44:12,280
would be equivalent to treason.

980
00:44:12,280 --> 00:44:12,810
But to act

981
00:44:13,590 --> 00:44:15,250
would also be deemed treason.

982
00:44:20,030 --> 00:44:20,840
Third Master,

983
00:44:21,390 --> 00:44:23,590
is there any way to break this deadlock?

984
00:44:24,000 --> 00:44:24,920
There is a way,

985
00:44:26,670 --> 00:44:28,400
but it's extremely dangerous.

986
00:44:44,360 --> 00:44:47,830
[A Splendid Match]

